Generate a standalone C reproducer that triggers this vulnerability:

File: loongarch/filter_lsx_intrinsics.c
Line: 326
Function: png_read_filter_row_paeth3_lsx
Bug type: out-of-bounds-read
CWE: CWE-125
Explanation: __lsx_vldrepl_w(prev_nxt, 0) reads 4 bytes from the previous row even when only 3 bytes are valid (e.g., width 1, 3 bpp), causing a 1-byte out-of-bounds read.

